  "description": "The runtime half of the XamlQuality theme audit, as source files an Avalonia test project\n      compiles against its own Avalonia. It builds each audited theme and variant in the running\n      application, asks Application.TryGetResource for every key a consumer references, and reports\n      where Avalonia's answer differs from the audit's.\n\n      Source only: the package holds no assembly and references no Avalonia package, so the check\n      runs against whatever Avalonia the adopting project pins. It depends on\n      Bennewitz.Ninja.XamlQuality at a minimum of the same release, whose RuntimeCheckPlan does\n      the rest.",
